message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "hasta-yonlendirme: A contactless face recognition kiosk for patient wayfinding in hospitals"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kaygusuz
    given-names: Yusuf Sami
    affiliation: Yalova University, Department of Computer Engineering
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-31
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/YusufsKaygusuz/hasta-yonlendirme"
url: "https://www.yusufskaygusuz.com/en/posts/yuz-tanima-hasta-yonlendirme/"
abstract: >-
  A low-cost kiosk that recognises patients at a hospital entrance, looks up their
  appointment and shows the way to the clinic, with a national-ID fallback and
  privacy-preserving storage. Developed as a TÜBİTAK 2209-A undergraduate research project.
keywords:
  - face recognition
  - raspberry pi
  - hospital wayfinding
  - patient routing
  - kiosk
